    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Spacious Four-Bedroom Detached Home on a Large Corner Plot\r\n\r\nRedmond Property are delighted to present 104 Millview Lawns to the market. Ideally positioned within this highly regarded and sought-after development on the outskirts of Malahide village, this impressive four-bedroom detached home with garage offers generous living accommodation, a substantial corner site and, importantly, excellent potential for modernisation and improvement.\r\n\r\nWhile the property requires modernisation, its spacious proportions, detached layout and large corner plot provide an excellent opportunity for those looking to create a wonderful family home in a highly desirable location.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation extends to a welcoming entrance hall with guest WC, two generous reception rooms, kitchen and integrated garage. Upstairs, there are four well-proportioned bedrooms, three double and one single, together with the main family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe large corner site is a particular feature of the property, offering considerable scope for landscaping and, subject to the necessary planning permissions, potential to further enhance and extend the accommodation. There are two driveways from Millview Road and Millview Lawns.\r\n\r\nThe property is within easy reach of Malahide village, renowned for its attractive streetscape, excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, pubs, boutiques and local services. Malahide Castle and its extensive parklands are also close by, providing superb recreational amenities including beautiful walks, mature grounds and open spaces.\r\n\r\nThe area is exceptionally well served by transport links, with Malahide Dart station providing convenient access to Dublin city centre and surrounding areas. There are also excellent road links to Dublin Airport, the M50 and the city centre. A wide range of primary and secondary schools, sporting clubs, coastal amenities and recreational facilities are available locally.\r\n\r\n104 Millview Lawns presents an excellent opportunity for the discerning purchaser offering suberb potential to create a truly impressive home in the right hands!\r\n\r\nACCOMMODATION (Ground Floor)\r\n(Please refer to the floor plan for room measurements)\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall with guest w.c. w.h.b., spotlights, tiled walls\r\nLiving room with fireplace, wall panelling, wall lights\r\nDining room access to kitchen\r\nKitchen wall/floor units, spotlights, sink, plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher, door to rear\r\nGarage with up and over door\r\n\r\nACCOMMODATION (First Floor)\r\n\r\nBedroom (1) with w.h.b., large double wardrobe\r\nBedroom (2) large double wardrobe, wall lights\r\nBedroom (3) \r\nBedroom (4) \r\nBathroom with w.c., w.h.b, bath, electric shower, partly tiled walls\r\n\r\nFEATURES\r\n\r\nLarge end plot with superb potential\r\nIntegrated garage\r\nTwo driveways\r\nFour spacious bedrooms\r\nGuest w.c.\r\nOil fired central heating\r\nD/G uPVC windows\r\nWalled gardens front, side and rear\r\nMature well sought after location\r\nClose to village, Malahide Castle and all local amenities\r\n\r\nVIEWING\r\nBy appointment with Redmond Property (Swords)\r\nContact Alan Redmond FIPAV"
      },
